  m_text: "Effective Date: Dec 20 2024\n\nAt Ryd Studios, we respect your privacy.
    This policy explains how your information is collected, used, and protected while
    playing Martian Frontier. By downloading and playing the game, you agree to the
    terms below.\n\n1. Information We Collect\n\nWe collect two types of information:\n\na.
    Personal Information\nWe do not collect personal information (e.g., name, email,
    phone number) unless you voluntarily provide it (e.g., for support requests).\n\nb.
    Non-Personal Information\nWe collect non-personal information, including:\n\n-
    Device information (e.g., operating system, device model).\n- Gameplay statistics
    (e.g., session length, in-game progress).\n- Advertising data (e.g., ad interactions).\n\nThis
    data is collected through third-party tools like Unity Analytics and Google AdMob.\n\n2.
    How We Use Your Information\n\nThe information we collect is used for:\n\n- Improving
    game performance and user experience.\n- Showing relevant ads via Google AdMob.\n-
    Tracking gameplay trends with Unity Analytics to improve future updates.\n\nWe
    do not sell or share your data with unauthorized third parties.\n\n3. Third-Party
    Services\n\nMartian Frontier uses third-party tools that may collect and process
    your data:\n\na. Unity Analytics\nUsed to analyze game performance and user behavior.
    Learn more about Unity's privacy policy at unity.com/legal/privacy-policy.\n\nb.
    Google AdMob\nUsed to serve in-game ads. Learn more about Google\u2019s privacy
    policy on their website.\n\nThese services may collect additional data as per
    their privacy policies.\n\n4. Data Protection\n\nWe implement industry-standard
    security measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission or
    storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.\n\n5. International
    Users\n\nYour data may be transferred to, processed, and stored in countries
    outside of your residence. By using Martian Frontier, you consent to such transfers.\n\n6.
    Your Rights\n\nDepending on your region, you may have rights regarding your data,
    including the ability to access, update, or delete it. Contact us at team.rydstudios@gmail.com
    for requests.\n\n7. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n\nWe may update this policy
    from time to time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting. Please
    review this policy periodically for updates.\n\n8. Contact Us\nIf you have any
    questions or concerns about this policy, please contact us at:\nEmail: team.rydstudios@gmail.com.\n\nBy
    playing Martian Frontier, you agree to this privacy policy."
